Package: greta.benchmarks
Title: Benchmarks for greta
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nicholas", "Tierney", , "nicholas.tierney@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1460-8722"))
Description: Benchmark runs for greta, kept so that a speed claim in NEWS.md
    or in a code comment can point at the code that produced it rather than at
    a number somebody typed out. Not a package: this file exists so the
    dependencies a run needs are declared in one place and can be installed
    with pak::pak() or renv.
